    {
      "role": "step",
      "content": "\u003cdiv class\u003d\"step_content\"\u003e\n \u003cp\u003ePress \u003cimg id\u003d\"token_20145\" class\u003d\"text-bottom\" src\u003d\"/specialchars/q2.gif\"\u003e to find the area.\u003c/p\u003e\n \u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\u003cimg class\u003d\"graphimgstatic id\u003d\" figure-3 src\u003d\"/modules/gcprealgpractice/gcprealgpractice_9_1_areasandvolumes_5b_80/f-80-5b-2.gif\"\u003e\n\u003cbr\u003e",
      "figure": null,
      "figures": null
    },
    {
      "role": "hint",
      "content": "\u003cdiv class\u003d\"step_content\"\u003e\n \u003cp\u003eMake sure the cursor is over a vertex, and press \u003cimg id\u003d\"token_20146\" class\u003d\"text-bottom\" src\u003d\"/specialchars/qenter.gif\" onmouseout\u003d\"return parent.doMouseOut()\" onmouseover\u003d\"return parent.doMouseOver(\u0026quot;token_20146\u0026quot;,144)\"\u003e.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e",
      "figure": null,
      "figures": null
    },
    {
      "role": "step",
      "content": "\u003cdiv class\u003d\"step_content\"\u003e\n \u003cp\u003eMake sure the cursor is over one of the vertices of the kite, and press \u003cimg id\u003d\"token_20147\" class\u003d\"text-bottom\" src\u003d\"/specialchars/qenter.gif\" onmouseout\u003d\"return parent.doMouseOut()\" onmouseover\u003d\"return parent.doMouseOver(\u0026quot;token_20147\u0026quot;,144)\"\u003e.\u003c/p\u003e\n \u003cp\u003eThe calculator gives the area as 21 square units.\u003c/p\u003e\n \u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n \u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\u003cimg class\u003d\"graphimgstatic id\u003d\" figure-5 src\u003d\"/modules/gcprealgpractice/gcprealgpractice_9_1_areasandvolumes_5b_80/f-80-5b-3.gif\"\u003e\n\u003cbr\u003e",
